# Absolute path to an OAI "Complete Data - ASCII" download on this machine. One
# line; # starts a comment. Gitignored -- copy to oai_clinical_root.txt and edit.
#
# Needed ONLY by pipeline/derive_table_ed1_cohort.py (the cohort table). The
# OAI clinical files are participant-level data under the OAI data-use
# agreement and are never vendored into the data root; obtain them from
# https://nda.nih.gov/oai (create an account, accept the terms, download
# "Complete Data - ASCII", unzip). The directory must contain General_ASCII/,
# AllClinical_ASCII/ and "X-Ray Image Assessments_ASCII/".
#
# Resolution order: $OAI_CLINICAL_ROOT -> oai_clinical_root.txt -> fail loudly

/path/to/OAI_Clinical_Data/Complete_Data_ASCII
